{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41917","headline":"再游洞神宫怀邵羽人有感 · 李中","name":"再游洞神宫怀邵羽人有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重向烟萝省旧游，因寻遗迹想浮丘。\n峰头鹤去三清远，坛畔月明千古秋。\n泉落小池清复咽，云从高峤起还收。\n自慙未得冲虚术，白发无情渐满头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}